  "项目实测": "第15章实验 34文件/423050字节/921锚点；Python in 0.7ms 921/921；pyahocorasick build 1.5ms scan 4.0ms 命中708；ahocorasick_rs build 3.0ms scan 1.9ms 命中624；逐条 membership 921/921 0.3ms；921→708唯一、213精确重复、91真子串。脚本：$env:TEMP\\t4_bench.py 等",
